  "[action] goes to his sons",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Chen Fu demands his sons account for their wealth.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Eldest son gives Chen Fu money from his business",
  "[says] Chen Fu asks about his sons' wealth.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Whence is all this silver and gold?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son shrugs and replies.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"From the towns and the villages and from the land, and from the rich men.\"",
  "[action] Chen Fu feels proud and content.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"I do not like to be so poor, and I would not live in my father's house if I did not have this land and this money.\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu asks why his son does not live in the town.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Why do you not live in the town and why do you not buy a house?\"",
